  5675	}
  5676	# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  5677	# PLAN-155 Wave 5 — Codex harness refresh (round-trip). When the effective
  5678	# harness (explicit --harness or replayed request.harness) is codex, refresh
  5679	# the .codex/ bundle from the (possibly newer) templates. Collision behavior
  5680	# mirrors the claude upgrade's --on-conflict: refuse (default) leaves a locally
  5681	# changed file, backup/theirs overwrite with a backup. A refusal WARNS, never
  5682	# fails the upgrade (consistent with the ADR-155 default). Runs BEFORE the
  5683	# state rewrite so codex ops are journaled.
  5684	# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
